# ── Review captures ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `artifacts/` is the evidence trail of every director round: paired Studio
# captures and their resolution dumps. It is 241 MB of the 261 MB on disk, it
# is REGENERABLE (the capture tools and the scenario rig are both in-tree), and
# a clone of this library should not carry a quarter of a gigabyte of PNGs.
#
# The WRITING in artifacts/ is kept: the specs, the ledgers, the review packets
# and the director rulings verbatim. Those are the decisions; the screenshots
# are what the decisions were made from.
artifacts/**/*.png
artifacts/**/*.jpg
artifacts/**/*.jpeg
artifacts/**/*.mov
artifacts/**/*.mp4
artifacts/**/*.json
artifacts/**/*.log

# build output + editor/OS noise
build/
sourcemap.json
.DS_Store

# Studio holds an open place open with a .lock beside it — never a repo artifact
*.rbxl.lock
